mlxflow 0.8
1. Read CSV                sales.csv
2. Query Table             group=region; columns=region,revenue
3. Chart                   kind=bar; x=region; y=revenue
4. Save Image              revenue-by-region.png

5. Table to Text   (2)     format=markdown
6. Draft                   Qwen3 8B; "3 insights and 1 anomaly, from this
                           table"
7. Template        (5,6)   "{1}\n\n{2}"
8. Save Text               sales-insights.md
